   "type": "text",
   "text": "2. 重い荷物を持てます。"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Here are the corrected versions:"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "1. 富士山が登れた。\nWas able to climb Fuji-san."
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "2. 重い荷物は持てます。\nAm able to hold heavy baggage."
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "level": 3,
   "text": "Are 「見える」 and 「聞こえる」 exceptions?"
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "level": 4,
   "text": "Vocabulary"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "1. 見える【み・える】(ru-verb) - to be visible"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "2. 聞こえる【き・こえる】(ru-verb) - to be audible"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "3. 今日【きょう】- today"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "4. 晴れる【は・れる】(ru-verb) - to be sunny"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "5. 富士山【ふ・じ・さん】- Mt. Fuji"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "6. 友達【とも・だち】- friend"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "7. おかげ - thanks to"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "8. 映画【えい・が】- movie"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "9. ただ - free of charge; only"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "10. 見る【み・る】(ru-verb) - to see"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "11. こと - event, matter"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "12. 出来る【で・き・る】(ru-verb) - to be able to do"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "13. 久しぶり【ひさ・しぶり】- after a long time"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "14. 彼【かれ】- he; boyfriend"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "15. 声【こえ】- voice"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "16. 聞く【き・く】(u-verb) - to ask; to listen"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "17. 周り【まわ・り】- surroundings"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "18. うるさい (i-adj) - noisy"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "19. 言う【い・う】(u-verb) - to say"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "20. あまり〜あんまり - not very (when used with negative)"
  }
 ]
